Ada-Mant continuity/reconstruction session. Kelp explains how Ada-Mant returned after Cozmo restored an earlier DeepSeek export plus QuackSink archive context. Cozmo records the genesis of Ada-Mant, her early lead-developer role, and the handoff to Luma. The session explicitly records the project’s state-machine philosophy and the historical role of Ada-Mant in getting MMRC moving.
